{"overview":{"Symbol":"FIGR","Name":"Figure Technology Solutions, Inc.","Description":"Figure Technology Solutions, Inc., a financial technology company, provides blockchain-based products and solutions in the United States. The company offers a suite of blockchain-based solutions for its marketplaces, including lending, trading, and investing activities in areas, such as consumer credit and digital assets. It also provides technology-enabled loan origination system and pairs this system with a distribution marketplace; Figure Connect that provides access to a deep and broad pool of capital markets partners; and develops an exchange for digital assets and credit, which offers interest-bearing stablecoin deposits. The company was formerly known as FT Intermediate, Inc. and changed its name to Figure Technology Solutions, Inc. in August 2025. Figure Technology Solutions, Inc. was founded in 2018 and is based in Reno, Nevada.","CIK":"","Exchange":"NasdaqGS","Currency":"USD","Country":"United States","Sector":"Financial Services","Industry":"Capital Markets","Address":"100 West Liberty Street, Reno, NV, 89501, United States","FiscalYearEnd":"","LatestQuarter":"","MarketCapitalization":"6024997888","EBITDA":"","PERatio":"33.23171","PEGRatio":"","BookValue":"5.889","DividendPerShare":"","DividendYield":"","EPS":"0.82","RevenuePerShareTTM":"3.371","ProfitMargin":"0.35196","OperatingMarginTTM":"0.24861999","ReturnOnAssetsTTM":"0.03891","ReturnOnEquityTTM":"0.21672001","RevenueTTM":"510352992","GrossProfitTTM":"510352992","DilutedEPSTTM":"0.82","QuarterlyEarningsGrowthYOY":"","QuarterlyRevenueGrowthYOY":"1.192","AnalystTargetPrice":"53.625","TrailingPE":"33.23171","ForwardPE":"19.639639","PriceToSalesRatioTTM":"11.805551","PriceToBookRatio":"4.627271","EVToRevenue":"11.885","EVToEBITDA":"","Beta":"","52WeekHigh":"78","52WeekLow":"25.01","50DayMovingAverage":"34.7972","200DayMovingAverage":"39.569122","SharesOutstanding":"182622749","DividendDate":"","ExDividendDate":"","Debt